# Free Malaysia Today (FMT)

> Free Malaysia Today is an independent Malaysian digital news publication covering politics, business, world affairs, lifestyle, and sports in Malaysia and beyond. Founded in 2009 and headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, FMT is one of Malaysia's leading English and Bahasa Malaysia news sources.

